<section class="aboutusHome" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="row v-center no-gutters">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12">
                <div class="leftbgBlog">
                    <!--<img src="https://assets-global.website-files.com/61b180d27163ab87d8f8bd03/61b438366c48b2b1a5670a1a_high-quality-materials-apparel-x-webflow-template.jpg" class="aboutLeft img-fluid" />-->
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 reveal">
                <div class="aboutRight">
                    <div class="dividerClass"></div>
                    <div class="headingBar">
                        <h3>Welcome to RJ Kapdaaz - Create your Identity</h3>

                    </div>
                    <p>
                        <span style="font-weight: 600">At RJ Kapdaaz,</span> we take pride in offering top-quality linens and uniforms that bring comfort, style, and functionality to your daily life. <span style="font-weight: 600">Made in India,</span> our product range spans two core categories: Linen and Uniforms, both designed to meet the highest standards of excellence and durability.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <span style="font-weight: 600">In our Linen Collection,</span> we work with trusted brands such as <span style="font-weight: 600"> Welspun India.</span> We offer an array of premium items such as Bed Linen, Hospital Linen, Mattresses, Pillows & Cushions, Bed Runners, Duvets & Comforters, Blankets, Bath Mats, Napkins, and Bath Towels. These products are meticulously crafted to elevate your spaces with comfort and luxury.
                    </p>
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 600">In our Uniforms Collection,</span> we exclusively use products from <span style="font-weight: 600">Mafatlal, S.Kumars, Siyarams, and Valji.</span> We cater to industries that prioritize professionalism and quality, including Hospitals, Hotels, and the Corporates. We offer T-shirts, Aprons, Kurtas, Blazers, Waistcoats, Safaris, and specialized uniforms that ensure your team looks and feels their best while on the job.</p>
                    <div class="butnSecton">
                        <a class="btn blackBtn" href="@Url.Action("about","Home")"><span>View More</span></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

